; The Space Invaders machine on the Pico W with the LAFVIN ST7796 panel,
; running YOUR ROM: first embed it (it stays out of git),
;   py -3 tools/embed_rom.py <folder with invaders.h/g/f/e, or one 8 KB file> src/inv_rom_user.pmi
